{"toolCallId":"call_c6e6eb7dd74e435bbae27863cfd7526a","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"dryRun\": true,\n  \"scope\": \"scoped\",\n  \"root\": \"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w4fbf614733/tree/specs\",\n  \"totalSpecFolders\": 1,\n  \"created\": 0,\n  \"refreshed\": 1,\n  \"changed\": 1,\n  \"existing\": 1,\n  \"lineageStamped\": 0,\n  \"skipped\": [],\n  \"failed\": [],\n  \"reviewFlags\": [\n    {\n      \"specFolder\": \"zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag\",\n      \"flags\": [\n        \"prose_relationship_hints\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"drift\": [\n    {\n      \"specFolder\": \"zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        \"description\",\n        \"causal_summary\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"pruneCandidates\": []\n}\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w4fbf614733/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"28741e","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
