{"toolCallId":"call_f7d3636f044e42a981e2be07561fed10","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-files.sh\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-template-source.sh\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-level-match.sh\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/heal-spec-docs.cjs\n---\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-template-source.sh:11:# Description: Checks that spec documents include SPECKIT_TEMPLATE_SOURCE header\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-template-source.sh:45:    local -a missing_header=()\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-template-source.sh:58:        local has_header=false\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-template-source.sh:60:            has_header=true\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-template-source.sh:63:        if [[ \"$has_header\" == false ]]; then\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-template-source.sh:64:            missing_header+=(\"$doc_name\")\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-template-source.sh:78:    if [[ ${#missing_header[@]} -gt 0 ]]; then\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-template-source.sh:80:        RULE_MESSAGE=\"Template source header missing in ${#missing_header[@]} file(s)\"\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-template-source.sh:82:        for file in \"${missing_header[@]-}\"; do\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-template-source.sh:83:            RULE_DETAILS+=(\"$file: Missing <!-- SPECKIT_TEMPLATE_SOURCE: ... --> header\")\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w4fbf614733/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"7bfdd5","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
